<title>SWEDEN: No Swedish bond auction because of holidays.</title>
<headline>No Swedish bond auction because of holidays.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's national debt office said there would be no regular bond auction announced on Wednesday because of Christmas holidays.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman told Reuters that at 0830 GMT on December 10, the debt office would publish preliminary dates for upcoming issues and say when auction conditions would be announced.</p>
<p>-- Barbara Taltavull, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1019</p>
